      "message": "I\u0027ve just tried commenting out all the above steps except this triple fault, and then, on PTL, when I\u0027m triggering a pKVM panic, it doesn\u0027t reboot, it just completely hangs.\n\nIt looks like it is not getting warm. So my guess is that this code fails to trigger a triple fault for some reason, so it enters HLT below? (And hopefully all other CPUs vmexit to pKVM and enter HLT too, thanks to the INIT before.)",
      "revId": "882daf5c9232886e6df52c09afed5a87f874060c",
